Subject: [PATCH] Add calendar state holder and LONG date formatting

CalendarViewModel keeps the displayed month, the selected day and the
per-month projection. Paid state is fetched only for manual-confirmation
expenses. The day detail needs a localized LONG date, which the existing
Medium-style actuals cannot produce, so add a small expect/actual next to
toMonthYearStringUTC.
